WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,170
Mr. Shen

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:02,990
Becoming more and more self-aware

3
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:05,350
Those who do not behave well are sent there for education.

4
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,150
Sure enough, I learned a lot

5
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,090
It's a pity it's too late

6
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,490
Miss Xian

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,820
If I had known this, why wait?

8
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,180
If you had learned better three years ago

9
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,980
I won't be in the current situation

10
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,880
Do you think so?

11
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,260
Mr. Shen was teaching Miss Xian a lesson

12
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,600
You opened my eyes again today, you said

13
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,360
If your brother sees you now

14
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,760
Wagging his tail and making a pitiful look

15
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,200
Will he make Mr. Shen angry to death?

16
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,600
I don’t have a brother. I’ve killed people and been in jail.

17
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,400
Now he is a show of ugliness and laughter

18
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,840
How could the Xian family have a murderer as their daughter, Jian Tong?

19
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:43,340
I underestimated you in the past because you were so cold-blooded

20
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,740
No wonder he could do such vicious things back then

21
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,400
But I'm curious

22
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:49,670
This cold-hearted and useless district guest

23
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:53,470
Is she also cold-blooded or hot-blooded, Ms. Shen?

24
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:54,670
what did you call me
